      "key": "opscen",
      "name": "OpScen",
      "prefix": "OPS",
      "description": "Operational scenarios / concept of operations (ConOps) for the RBC: how trains, signallers and neighbouring systems use it step by step, e.g. Start of Mission, Movement Authority extension, Handover RBC-RBC, Emergency stop and degraded modes. Stakeholder requirements are derived from them.",
